==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|*}}

# To [[wait]] until the specified event occurs.
#: {{syn|en|await|wait on|q2=colloquial|Thesaurus:wait for}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Wait for''' the light to change before you cross the street.}}
#: {{ux|en|What are you '''waiting for'''?}}
# To [[await]] the arrival of.
#: {{syn|en|await|wait on|q2=colloquial|Thesaurus:wait for}}
#: {{ux|en|I'm '''waiting for''' my date.}}
#: {{ux|en|I'm '''waiting for''' the train.}}

====Translations====
{{trans-see|await}}

